<h1 align="center">KDOS</h1>

<p align="center"><b><i>I use KDOS btw.</i></b></p>

<p align="center">
A Linux distribution compiled from source, one <code>kpkgbuild</code> at a time  [11;1H—[11;2H<br>
with a desktop that is a character grid all the way down.
</p>

<p align="center">
<b>musl</b> ·[16;15H<b>toybox</b> ·[16;31H<b>wlroots</b> ·[16;48H<b>no systemd</b> ·[16;68H<b>no Xorg</bb[17;1H> ·[17;5H<b>no GTK or Qt on the host</b>
</p>

<p align="center">
<sub>764 ports ·[21;18HLinux 7.0.10 ·[21;33H758 packages ·[21;48H181 containerised applications ·[21;80H  [22;1Hbuilds offline from this repo</sub>
